NanoASR bundles and links against third-party components:

  sherpa-onnx            Apache-2.0   https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
  onnxruntime            MIT          https://github.com/microsoft/onnxruntime
  sherpa-onnx-go         Apache-2.0   https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx-go

The Docker image additionally installs ffmpeg from the distribution, which is
licensed under LGPL-2.1+ or GPL-2+ depending on the build. NanoASR invokes it
as a separate process and does not link against it.

Model weights are NOT part of this repository and carry their own licences,
some of which are non-commercial. Each catalog entry records its licence, the
UI displays it, and registry.strict_license refuses to load weights that are
not licensed for commercial use.
